{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n肥媽（Maria Cordero）愛狗如命，對家中毛孩的照顧更是無微不至，沒想到連飲食都極盡奢華！她在節目中驚爆家中狗狗的「富貴餐單」，竟然連冬蟲夏草、鮑魚都成為牠們的盤中餐，肥媽更苦笑自爆自己在家中的地位，場面令人哭笑不得，究竟狗狗們的伙食有多誇張？\n</p>\n<h2>肥媽自爆狗狗奢華餐單 補品多到數唔晒</h2>\n<p>肥媽在節目中強調，她對狗狗的飲食極為注重，絕不會因為牠們是唐狗而有任何輕視。她透露家中狗狗的日常飲食中，維他命和各種營養品多不勝數，務求讓牠們保持最佳健康狀態。最令人震驚的是，連一般人都視為珍品的冬蟲夏草和鮑魚，竟然也成為了狗狗們的雜食和點心，豪氣程度令人咋舌。</p>\n<h2>肥媽苦笑投訴姐姐 燉補品只剩湯渣飲</h2>\n<p>談到狗狗的奢華飲食，肥媽忍不住苦笑著「投訴」家中的傭工姐姐。她說：「我啲姐姐（傭工）對啲狗狗好好，所以好健康㗎。」她接著分享爆笑經歷：「我燉嘅冬蟲夏草，返到屋企我淨係得碗湯㗎咋，啲湯渣畀佢哋餵狗。」更誇張的是，連燉鮑魚也遭遇同樣命運：「每一個新嚟姐姐都畀啲勁嘢我，煲青邊鮑我又淨係得湯飲，啲鮑魚同肉畀晒啲狗食，所以佢哋好多補品。」字裡行間流露出對狗狗被寵愛的無奈又甜蜜的喜悅。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到嘩嘩聲：「狗狗食得好過我！」</h2>\n<p>肥媽的分享引來網民熱烈討論，不少人對狗狗的「帝王級」伙食表示震驚。「貧窮限制了我的想像，隻狗食鮑魚！」「肥媽啲姐姐係咪都係愛狗之人，笑死。」「我連冬蟲夏草係咩味都唔知，隻狗已經食緊。」「證明肥媽真係錫啲狗，唔係口講，肯使錢。」「做肥媽隻狗都幾幸福！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_4237351826b0013fde0284.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_4237351826b0013fde0284.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_447721826b0014086397e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_447721826b0014086397e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_12711976566b001411c4d0e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_12711976566b001411c4d0e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:50.839339+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":876,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:36:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:57:26.739213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:57:23.130722+00:00","content_hash":"8f964c4f2e7efe59d511a41de8c426e2ede473bc15efc0980883b5624fb3ea24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}